      "items": [
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_01",
          "content": "当我在一件对自己很重要的事情上失败时，我会被“自己不够好”的感觉深深困住。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 0,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_02",
          "content": "对于自己性格中不喜欢的部分，我会尽量抱着理解和耐心对待。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_03",
          "content": "发生让自己痛苦的事时，我会努力用比较平衡的角度来看待。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_04",
          "content": "心情低落时，我常觉得其他人大概都比我过得快乐。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_05",
          "content": "我会试着把自己的不足看作每个人都可能有的经历。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_06",
          "content": "经历很困难的时刻时，我会给自己需要的关心与温柔对待。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_07",
          "content": "遇到令人难受的事时，我会努力让自己的情绪保持平衡。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_08",
          "content": "在一件对自己重要的事情上失败时，我常觉得只有自己经历了这样的失败。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_09",
          "content": "心情低落时，我容易不断纠结眼前所有不顺利的事情。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_10",
          "content": "觉得自己在某方面不够好时，我会提醒自己：很多人也有类似的不足感。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 9,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_11",
          "content": "面对自己的缺点或不足，我经常会批评和否定自己。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 10,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "SCS_SF12_12",
          "content": "对于自己性格中不喜欢的部分，我常常缺乏耐心，难以接纳。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 11,
          "responseSetKey": "scssf_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        }
      ],
